      "Changelog": "Version 20.0.0.11\n\n- Fixed Ragworm sometimes not getting bought if you were standing near an aetheryte.\n- Plugins which are turned off while running now will re-enable 30 seconds after it stops.\n- Fish and hunt data now come with the plugin, no more downloading.\n- Moon missions got a lot of love:\n    - Fixed the fish lists in 118 missions, which had the wrong fish or were missing one\n    - Uses lures, Surface Slap and Identical Cast where they actually help\n    - Knows the right bait and mooch chain for each fish\n    - Throws back bites it doesn't need and picks Double or Triple Hook based on what's probably biting\n    - Goes after intuition fish faster, and more often in score missions\n- New setting, \"Reel in late casts\": if nothing bites in time, it reels in and tries again.\n- New setting, \"Save a chain fish for when the target can bite\": it keeps a fish with Spareful Hand and fishes with it the moment the big one can bite.\n- The cordial setting is now just \"Never\", \"Smart\" or \"When low on GP\".",
